1
00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:04.318
Unit nine. HIV Prevention and Stigma!

2
00:00:05.257 --> 00:00:09.386
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.436 --> 00:00:12.300
